        }
      ],
      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update gradle-8 to 8.14.5-r8 or later.",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-71497: when a custom Safelist permits raw-text elements, the jsoup Cleaner could mis-handle a malformed tag name ending in a control character and emit text as active markup, allowing XSS; jsoup's built-in Safelists are not affected. jsoup 1.14.3 before 1.23.1 is affected and 1.23.1 carries the fix: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pmhh-3w7g-xqp8, https://github.com/jhy/jsoup/commit/92f1aca552548b484bc7d4b94c51e48b8e6eca70. Read the Maven metadata and manifest of every jar, nested jars included, in every published gradle-8 package for Alpine 3.23 in the DHI Alpine repository (16 versions, 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.8-r0; the x86_64 and aarch64 packages of each version are byte-identical, and 8.14.5-r4 is published for x86_64 only). Gradle ships jsoup as /usr/share/java/gradle/lib/jsoup-<version>.jar, and no other jar in these packages contains jsoup classes, relocated or not. Builds 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.5-r7 ship jsoup 1.15.3, 8.14.5-r8 and 8.14.5-r9 ship 1.23.1, and 8.14.6-r0 and every later build ship 1.23.2. The range ends at 8.14.5-r8, the first build with jsoup 1.23.1 or later."
    },
